<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Agouron upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Agouron upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it upgraded Agouron Pharmaceuticals Inc to buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited strength of Viracept product line.</p>
<p>-- Raised price target to $120 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-7/8 to 87-3/4.</p>
</text>
